{"key":"kth-stream-2cd9947489da715e","sourceHash":"2cd9947489da715ea7a8702048b1f2bf4c1deedb87fc2f83d6b9a2de7d51fffc","pattern":"kth-stream","category":"heaps-streaming","title":"Kth Statistic in a Stream: Mental Model","idea":"Keep k candidates so the heap root is the kth largest value after every insertion.","complexity":"O(log k) per item · O(k) space","source":"fn csv<T: std::fmt::Display>(a: impl IntoIterator<Item = T>) -> String {\n    a.into_iter()\n        .map(|x| x.to_string())\n        .collect::<Vec<_>>()\n        .join(\",\")\n}\nfn kth_largest_stream(values: &[i32], k: usize) -> Vec<i32> {\n    assert!(k > 0);\n    let mut heap = std::collections::BinaryHeap::new();\n    let mut out = Vec::new();\n    for &x in values {\n        heap.push(std::cmp::Reverse(x));\n        if heap.len() > k {\n            heap.pop();\n        }\n        if heap.len() == k {\n            out.push(heap.peek().unwrap().0);\n        }\n    }\n    out\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let result = csv(kth_largest_stream(&[4, 5, 8, 2, 10], 3));\n    println!(\"{result}\");\n}\n","sites":[{"line":8,"function":"kth_largest_stream","statement":"assert!(k > 0);"},{"line":9,"function":"kth_largest_stream","statement":"let mut heap = std::collections::BinaryHeap::new();"},{"line":10,"function":"kth_largest_stream","statement":"let mut out = Vec::new();"},{"line":11,"function":"kth_largest_stream","statement":"for &x in values {"},{"line":12,"function":"kth_largest_stream","statement":"heap.push(std::cmp::Reverse(x));"},{"line":13,"function":"kth_largest_stream","statement":"if heap.len() > k {"},{"line":14,"function":"kth_largest_stream","statement":"heap.pop();"},{"line":15,"function":"kth_largest_stream","statement":"}"},{"line":16,"function":"kth_largest_stream","statement":"if heap.len() == k {"},{"line":17,"function":"kth_largest_stream","statement":"out.push(heap.peek().unwrap().0);"},{"line":18,"function":"kth_largest_stream","statement":"}"},{"line":20,"function":"kth_largest_stream","statement":"out"},{"line":24,"function":"main","statement":"let result = csv(kth_largest_stream(&[4, 5, 8, 2, 10], 3));"},{"line":25,"function":"main","statement":"println!(\"{result}\");"},{"line":26,"function":"main","statement":"}"}],"version":1,"input":"stream=[4,5,8,2,10]","stdout":"4,4,5\n","values":[{"type":"&[i32]","data":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"4"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"5"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"8"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"2"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"10"}],"tuple":false}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"3"}},{"type":"alloc::collections::binary_heap::BinaryHeap<core::cmp::Reverse<i32>>","data":{"kind":"list","items":[],"tuple":false}},{"type":"alloc::vec::Vec<i32>","data":{"kind":"list","items":[],"tuple":false}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"4"}},{"type":"alloc::collections::binary_heap::BinaryHeap<core::cmp::Reverse<i32>>","data":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"named","name":"Reverse","value":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"4"}],"tuple":true}}],"tuple":false}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"5"}},{"type":"alloc::collections::binary_heap::BinaryHeap<core::cmp::Reverse<i32>>","data":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"named","name":"Reverse","value":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"4"}],"tuple":true}},{"kind":"named","name":"Reverse","value":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"5"}],"tuple":true}}],"tuple":false}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"8"}},{"type":"alloc::collections::binary_heap::BinaryHeap<core::cmp::Reverse<i32>>","data":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"named","name":"Reverse","value":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"4"}],"tuple":true}},{"kind":"named","name":"Reverse","value":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"5"}],"tuple":true}},{"kind":"named","name":"Reverse","value":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"8"}],"tuple":true}}],"tuple":false}},{"type":"alloc::vec::Vec<i32